        "original_id": "4e56fa5b-4d54-5365-bc62-00ec03f08d62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fabián Bielinsky, Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Oscar Núñez, Ricardo Darín, Gastón Pauls, Leticia Brédice, Tomás Fonzi, Alejandro Awada\n- Places: Buenos Aires, Argentina, Brazil\n- Works: Nine Queens, Good Life Delivery, Un novio para mi mujer\n- Roles: Film directors, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Nelson Pereira dos Santos, born on 22 October 1928, is a Brazilian film director.\n- Fabián Bielinsky, born on 3 February 1959 in Buenos Aires, was an Argentine film director who died on 28 June 2006.\n- Nine Queens is a 2000 Argentine crime drama film written and directed by Fabián Bielinsky.\n- Nine Queens stars Ricardo Darín, Gastón Pauls, Leticia Brédice, Tomás Fonzi, and Alejandro Awada.\n- Oscar Núñez had film credits including Nine Queens in 2000, Good Life Delivery in 2004, and Un novio para mi mujer in 2008.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
